{"version":"1.0.0","enabled":true,"name":"Sprint Tracker Update","description":"After agent execution completes, remind to update Sprint.md with progress and validation evidence.","when":{"type":"agentStop"},"then":{"type":"askAgent","prompt":"Work session ending. Before closing:\n1. If implementation was done: update Sprint.md progress log with today's date and what was delivered.\n2. If tests were run: note the result (e.g., '38 passed', 'dart analyze clean').\n3. If new files were created: add them to the sprint's 'Key files' section.\n4. If a checklist item was completed: mark it [x] in Sprint.md.\n5. If the sprint scope changed: note the deviation and rationale.\nKeep Sprint.md as the single source of truth for project status."}}